      "message": "Add Ssu32xl extension definition\n\nAdd YAML definition for the Ssu32xl (32-bit UXLEN) extension.\n\nSsu32xl indicates that the implementation supports 32-bit user mode,\nmeaning sstatus.UXL can be set to 1 (UXLEN=32). This allows U-mode\nto run 32-bit code on a 64-bit machine.\n\nCloses #1202",
